                        "text": "<p>Designed in Brooklyn. Made in small runs, packed by hand.</p><p>What's in the box:</p><ul><li>Painted MDF frame, 8 × 10\"</li><li>Color-matched acid-free mat</li><li>Protective glass</li><li>Backboard</li><li>Hanging hardware</li></ul><p>Opening fits a 1.75 × 2.25\" mini polaroid. Tape your photo to the back of the mat, seat it in the frame, and hang portrait or landscape.</p>",
