                    "text_WBYHAw": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>$8 flat rate shipping in the US, free over $80. We ship from Brooklyn within 2–3 business days, and orders typically arrive in 5–10 days once they're on the way. You'll get tracking by email.</p><p>Not shipping internationally yet, but if you're outside the US email hello@knocktwice.studio and we'll see what we can do.</p><p>If something arrives damaged, email us within 7 days with your order number and a few photos and we'll send a replacement or refund. Change your mind? Returns accepted within 14 days on unused frames in original packaging. Custom polaroid prints are final sale.</p><p>Full details <a href=\"https://www.knocktwice.studio/returns\" title=\"https://www.knocktwice.studio/returns\"><strong>here</strong></a>.</p>",
